.SS "double csmp::NaClMeltingCurve::PmeltFromT ()"

.PP
returns melting pressure [Pa] for given T [C] melting pressure for given temperature (eqn\&. 1 of Driesner & Heinrich (2007))

.PP
\fBAttention\fP
.RS 4
No range check is performed, current temperature may be out of valid range if higher than ca\&. 925C and less than NaCl triple point temperature (800\&.7 C)\&. 
.RE
.PP
